      "hizbQuarter": 93,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1564,
      "text": "They said, “O Shu‘ayb, we do not understand much of what you say, and we surely see you weak among us. Were it not for your clan, we would have surely stoned you, for you have no standing among us.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 232,
      "ruku": 190,
      "hizbQuarter": 93,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1565,
      "text": "He said, “O my people, does my clan have a higher status to you than Allah? And you have abandoned Him behind your backs. Indeed, my Lord encompasses all what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 232,
      "ruku": 190,
      "hizbQuarter": 93,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1566,
      "text": "O my people, do whatever you can; I will do mine. You will come to know who will receive a disgracing punishment, and who is a liar. Wait; I too am waiting with you.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 232,
      "ruku": 190,
      "hizbQuarter": 93,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1567,
      "text": "When Our command came, We saved Shu‘ayb and those who believed with him by Our mercy. But the huge blast seized the wrongdoers, so they fell dead in their homes,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 12,
