      "page": 232,
      "ruku": 190,
      "hizbQuarter": 93,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1568,
      "text": "as if they had never dwelt there. Behold, away with Midian just as it was with Thamūd!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
